      "worked": "The largest rectangular base is an inscribed square. Its diagonal is the cylinder's diameter, $4\\text{ cm}$. Let its side length be $s\\text{ cm}$.\n$$\\begin{align*}s^2+s^2&=4^2\\\\2s^2&=16\\\\s^2&=8\\\\V&=s^2\\times3\\\\V&=8\\times3\\\\V&=24\\text{ cm}^3\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
